ely rectangular wall of  these pointed arches and  um I thought that was a really cool look  to kind of imitate here so for me it's  just one corner and not a complete  rectangular Square because I'm still  trying to fit this into my themed land  but I think it kind of works to connect  the mosque to the dark right building  because  obviously this wall of arches is also  built to hide the dark right building  and uh we're also gonna have to do some  kind of transition to the architecture  of the musk station building uh to the  part where the two coasters enter uh the  Dark Ride section which is coming up  here and at the same time I'm trying my  hardest to make it look like a row of  different buildings but as it as is very  much the case in many theme parks it is  just a single building so trying to make  as many differences in color and Heights  and Architectural Styles along this row  of facants as possible but in reality  I'm just trying to hide one big gray box  from from the view of the park and we're  definitely gonna have to have some huge  backstage area behind this as well I'm  definitely gonna have to figure out what  I'm going to do with that roof structure  but those are worries for some later  dates I think for now I'm very concerned  and just focusing on the theming of it  now the last thing to mention about this  building in the corner is that at some  point in future it's going to have to  house the exit path with a gift shop and  a photo booth not entirely sure how  that's going to work out but um it's my  plan I'm trying to house as many things  like not just the ride itself but also  the queue line and everything else Under  One Roof over here because realistically  that's what a theme park like this would  do to conserve their space now moving on  to another facade in this row of  buildings this is going to be my  solution for the entry into the dark  right section for these coasters and  it's a little bit of an odd one but it's  one that I ar